# Local development settings. Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in locally.
# Real keys live in Google Secret Manager (see docs/RUNBOOK.md). Never commit values.
#
# LIVE=1 enables real calls to external APIs from local runs (default: off).
#
# Web (put in web/.env.local): public reCAPTCHA Enterprise site key for App Check.
# Only needed for a local production build; `npm run dev` uses the emulators without App Check.
# CI reads it from the `production` environment variable of the same name.
# VITE_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=
